{"title":"The Oil Thieves","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Kobolds creep into Greywood Camp&#39;s stores at night and carry the lamp oil off into Hollowmark. The Quartermaster wants it back.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/quartermaster\">Quartermaster</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"quartermaster\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/lamp-oil-flask\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/gen/95d82828cafb08e909e2.svg\" alt=\"\">Lamp Oil Flask</a> <b>×5</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/quartermaster\">Quartermaster</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors around -560, -366)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"quartermaster\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kobold diggers in the upper workings <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span><br>Lamp oil flasks <span class=\"muted\">(5)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/lamp-oil-flask\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/gen/95d82828cafb08e909e2.svg\" alt=\"\">Lamp Oil Flask</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -560, -366</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-560|-366|Lamp oil flasks\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>448</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>14,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Quartermaster says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Quartermaster:</b> Five flasks, and only one of them half empty. I&#39;ll take that.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Quartermaster:</b> They&#39;ll be back, but they&#39;ll think twice now. The foreman wants a word with you. He&#39;s been staring at that mine all morning.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"They&#39;ll be back, but they&#39;ll think twice now. The foreman wants a word with you. He&#39;s been staring at that mine all morning.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Oil Thieves</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-oil-thieves\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-oil-thieves\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-oil-thieves\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-oil-thieves\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-oil-thieves\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Quartermaster says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-oil-thieves\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}